# Root .easignore for EAS Build in monorepo layout.
#
# CRITICAL: eas-cli resolves .easignore at the Git repository root (/), NOT inside
# subdirectory project roots (sarix-go-driver/ or sarix-go-app/). Without this file at the
# repository root, eas-cli falls back to .gitignore rules and strips google-services.json
# from the archive uploaded to the EAS build worker.
#
# google-services.json is deliberately NOT listed here so the file decoded in CI is
# always uploaded to the EAS worker.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
venv/
env/
ENV/
.venv/
*.egg-info/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
/data/
taksi_baza.json
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
logs/
**/node_modules/
**/.expo/
**/dist/
**/web-build/
*.jks
*.keystore
sarix-go-app/ios/
sarix-go-app/android/
sarix-go-driver/ios/
sarix-go-driver/android/
